WEBVTT

01:38.966 --> 01:41.588
[Episode 2]

01:45.680 --> 01:47.359
Xing Wu! I...

01:47.359 --> 01:48.920
What's wrong?

01:48.920 --> 01:51.719
There are bugs.

01:51.719 --> 01:52.799
Bugs?

01:52.799 --> 01:54.988
So many big bugs!

01:59.720 --> 02:01.439
Did you see them?

02:01.439 --> 02:02.599
There are no big bugs.

02:02.599 --> 02:03.760
There are so many!

02:03.760 --> 02:05.439
Is it this one?

02:05.439 --> 02:08.619
Don't come over here! Stay back!

02:10.130 --> 02:12.280
What's the big deal?

02:12.280 --> 02:13.599
Just let it go?

02:13.599 --> 02:14.960
Screaming so loudly,

02:14.960 --> 02:17.280
you've scared off all its friends.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.439
It's fine.

02:18.439 --> 02:20.599
You'll get used to it after a few times.

02:20.599 --> 02:23.234
Hurry up and wash up.

02:42.800 --> 02:44.899
It's so hot.

02:47.919 --> 02:49.120
Aren't you hot?

02:49.120 --> 02:50.520
There's a sea breeze outside.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.360
And a fan inside.

02:52.360 --> 02:54.160
I'm not hot.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.199
An air conditioner is much cooler.

03:01.199 --> 03:02.439
Why don't you install one?

03:02.439 --> 03:04.939
A calm mind keeps you cool.

03:06.000 --> 03:07.319
If you're so hot,

03:07.319 --> 03:08.455
take the fan.

03:08.455 --> 03:11.280
Well, a used air conditioner
shouldn't cost much, right?

03:11.280 --> 03:14.000
How about this?
Let's split the cost and buy one.

03:14.000 --> 03:16.363
That way, after I leave, you can still use it.

03:16.363 --> 03:18.182
It's a win-win.

03:21.435 --> 03:23.319
I think that's a great idea.

03:23.319 --> 03:24.879
Given the conditions in Zhazhating,

03:24.879 --> 03:26.199
if you're so rich,

03:26.199 --> 03:28.319
you can install one in every house.

03:28.319 --> 03:29.680
Benefit the whole town.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.480
How about that?

03:57.240 --> 04:00.080
Are you going to sleep?

04:00.080 --> 04:01.360
You're not sleeping?

04:01.360 --> 04:04.439
Your mom said you wouldn't be back to sleep.

04:04.439 --> 04:06.759
You believe everything my mom says?

04:06.759 --> 04:09.120
No, I mean...

04:09.120 --> 04:12.100
Are you planning to sleep here tonight?

04:29.639 --> 04:33.120
You're not really planning
to sleep here, are you?

04:33.120 --> 04:35.300
I think the two of us...

04:36.360 --> 04:38.460
What about us?

04:39.279 --> 04:42.059
It's not appropriate for us to share a room.

04:54.000 --> 04:56.220
I agree.

05:20.040 --> 05:21.319
Are you asleep?

05:21.319 --> 05:22.439
How are you feeling?

05:22.439 --> 05:24.379
Are you adjusting okay?

05:30.079 --> 05:34.179
Land, die, box. It's a total disaster.

05:38.160 --> 05:41.214
Feels like you've jumped back 20 years in time.

05:42.800 --> 05:45.860
I'll go abroad once this month is over.

05:47.560 --> 05:50.160
By the way, did you send the package?

05:50.160 --> 05:52.360
Here's the tracking number and photo.

05:52.360 --> 05:54.399
I sent it via express. Keep an eye out for it.

05:54.399 --> 05:56.904
Also, you need to record a video
for your course application.

05:56.904 --> 05:57.991
Don't forget.

05:57.991 --> 05:59.199
If you need any help,

05:59.199 --> 06:01.259
I'm always here.

06:02.120 --> 06:03.600
Actually, the moment I got here,

06:03.600 --> 06:06.179
I wanted to go back to Beijing.

06:09.035 --> 06:12.238
But it's pretty hard for you
to go back to Beijing now, right?

06:43.274 --> 06:46.579
Wu, how's it going with our cousin?

06:48.639 --> 06:49.879
A girl from the big city

06:49.879 --> 06:52.160
is really something else.

06:52.800 --> 06:54.819
Wash up and go to bed.

08:06.319 --> 08:08.240
Coming!

08:08.240 --> 08:11.240
Sweet tofu pudding, millet porridge,
and pickles.

08:11.240 --> 08:13.300
Sit by the window.

08:14.079 --> 08:16.199
For breakfast: buns, wontons,
youtiao and tofu curd.

08:16.199 --> 08:18.279
- Your pick?
- A large bowl of three-flavor wontons.

08:18.279 --> 08:19.959
- With seaweed and dried shrimp.
- Auntie Jin!

08:19.959 --> 08:21.439
- Auntie Jin!
- Seaweed and dried shrimp.

08:21.439 --> 08:23.560
My mom sent me to buy
pork and cabbage dumplings.

08:23.560 --> 08:25.439
- Thirty of them.
- Thirty. Got it.

08:25.439 --> 08:27.540
Okay, I'll pick them up at noon.

08:29.710 --> 08:31.279
Hey, dear.

08:31.279 --> 08:33.039
Did Hu take his medicine?

08:33.039 --> 08:35.787
No. He said it's too bitter.

08:35.787 --> 08:37.120
If you want to be the best,

08:37.120 --> 08:38.639
you have to endure the worst.

08:38.639 --> 08:41.120
If he can't take this,
how can he cure his stutter?

08:41.120 --> 08:43.960
But the book says
all medicine is part poison, right?

08:43.960 --> 08:46.159
- Can't count on you. I'll handle it myself.
- Selling...

08:46.159 --> 08:48.695
Selling tofu!

08:49.662 --> 08:50.840
You're really something.

08:50.840 --> 08:53.120
- What's up?
- Look at you!

08:53.120 --> 08:54.879
- I'm riding here!
- Move! Everyone, move!

08:54.879 --> 08:57.720
Why is this so... How did you walk into me?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.759
Hurry up!

08:58.759 --> 09:00.519
Hurry up!

09:00.519 --> 09:03.300
Pay up now! Pay and we're done.

09:03.919 --> 09:05.679
- You can't even walk?
- Look at this!

09:05.679 --> 09:06.759
Pay up now!

09:06.759 --> 09:08.399
Pay up to settle it!

09:08.399 --> 09:12.159
Pay up! Pay up!
You're not leaving until you pay!

09:12.159 --> 09:14.519
What's all the noise so early?

09:14.519 --> 09:18.240
You're disturbing me.
I can call the police, you know?

09:18.240 --> 09:19.399
She...

09:19.399 --> 09:20.759
She said she's calling the police.

09:20.759 --> 09:23.200
- Arrest who?
- This girl is from the big city.

09:23.200 --> 09:25.279
She's got a bigger temper than you all.

09:25.279 --> 09:26.279
Break it up! Scatter!

09:26.279 --> 09:28.039
That won't do. This tofu can't be sold now.

09:28.039 --> 09:30.740
I'll buy all your tofu.

09:53.327 --> 09:55.120
It hurts!

09:55.120 --> 09:56.879
What's wrong?

09:56.879 --> 09:58.979
I didn't see it.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.600
- What happened?
- Wait! Don't!

10:01.600 --> 10:02.799
I haven't touched you yet.

10:02.799 --> 10:03.919
Help her up. Help her up.

10:03.919 --> 10:05.519
I didn't touch you, yet you're crying out.

10:05.519 --> 10:07.960
My foot, my foot!

10:07.960 --> 10:09.840
Easy. Take it easy!

10:09.840 --> 10:11.200
- I'm being easy.
- It hurts.

10:11.200 --> 10:13.279
- Hang in there. Anywhere else?
- Get up for a second.

10:13.279 --> 10:14.879
- Slowly.
- Okay.

10:14.879 --> 10:16.000
Take it easy, take it easy.

10:16.000 --> 10:18.120
It really, really hurts.

10:18.120 --> 10:20.279
Okay, okay. Slowly, slowly.

10:20.279 --> 10:22.260
Can't bend over.

10:25.080 --> 10:27.380
Where'd you get hurt?

10:28.240 --> 10:30.120
It's killing me.

10:30.120 --> 10:32.360
- It hurts so much.
- Ye.

10:32.360 --> 10:33.734
Your eyes...

10:33.734 --> 10:35.840
They look like the 2-dot tile.

10:35.840 --> 10:37.640
I...

10:40.200 --> 10:41.600
What's wrong with my eyes?

10:41.600 --> 10:43.440
How did this happen?

10:43.440 --> 10:44.759
Don't touch it with your hands.

10:44.759 --> 10:46.080
This...

10:46.080 --> 10:47.600
- What's going on?
- Well, your eyes

10:47.600 --> 10:49.399
probably got bitten by mosquitoes.

10:49.399 --> 10:51.320
This side looks like an allergic reaction.

10:51.320 --> 10:53.240
What should I do?

10:53.240 --> 10:54.759
Why can't I see clearly now?

10:54.759 --> 10:55.879
I used to see just fine.

10:55.879 --> 10:57.440
I'm not going blind, am I?

10:57.440 --> 11:00.000
Just shut up. My house isn't that toxic.
You won't go blind.

11:00.000 --> 11:01.080
Then what do we do now?

11:01.080 --> 11:03.840
It's okay. Let's get you to the clinic.

11:03.840 --> 11:06.200
But... My ID is still upstairs.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.879
- Stop rubbing it.
- You just need to show up.

11:07.879 --> 11:08.960
- Right.
- Then I...

11:08.960 --> 11:10.279
I have to go up and change.

11:10.279 --> 11:12.240
I can't go out in my PJs. So embarrassing.

11:12.240 --> 11:13.360
Out on the street.

11:13.360 --> 11:15.399
- Change for what? No one here cares.
- Exactly.

11:15.399 --> 11:16.919
Then... How about this, Auntie?

11:16.919 --> 11:18.159
Get me my sunglasses.

11:18.159 --> 11:19.639
S-Sunglasses...

11:19.639 --> 11:22.380
What sunglasses? You're already blind.

11:49.399 --> 11:50.519
Put me down!

11:50.519 --> 11:52.120
This is so embarrassing.

11:52.120 --> 11:54.679
Just cover your face.
Then no one will recognize you.

11:54.679 --> 11:57.339
Help! I really...

12:06.519 --> 12:07.639
Put me down!

12:07.639 --> 12:08.759
Dr. Zhuang!

12:08.759 --> 12:09.919
Someone's dying!

12:09.919 --> 12:11.600
You're the one who's dying.

12:11.600 --> 12:13.759
Is this tiny clinic really okay?

12:13.759 --> 12:17.120
In Zhazhating,
this is the first-class hospital.

12:17.120 --> 12:19.279
I want to go to a real first-class hospital.

12:19.279 --> 12:20.360
Fine.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.759
Five minutes to the bus stop,

12:21.759 --> 12:22.960
40 minutes on the bus,

12:22.960 --> 12:24.320
then another twenty-minute walk.

12:24.320 --> 12:25.440
Like 30 or 40 kilometers.

12:25.440 --> 12:26.519
Go there yourself.

12:26.519 --> 12:29.039
You're lying.

12:29.039 --> 12:31.519
Princess, stop being so dramatic.

12:31.519 --> 12:34.099
This is just how it is in Zhazhating.

12:39.399 --> 12:41.200
It's so early.

12:41.200 --> 12:43.120
What's wrong? Who's dying?

12:43.120 --> 12:46.120
- Her. She's dying.
- You're dying.

12:46.120 --> 12:48.360
Nonsense. What's wrong with you?

12:48.360 --> 12:50.399
Please, take a look.

12:50.399 --> 12:52.759
She's going blind and her leg is broken.

12:52.759 --> 12:54.600
This...

12:54.600 --> 12:56.979
More nonsense.

12:58.399 --> 13:00.120
Come on, let me see.

13:00.120 --> 13:02.459
Open your eyes. Let me see.

13:03.120 --> 13:05.260
Open them up.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.720
Come on, open up.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.960
Look up.

13:08.960 --> 13:11.000
Look down.

13:11.000 --> 13:13.120
Look left.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.200
Doctor,

13:14.200 --> 13:15.519
is just looking enough?

13:15.519 --> 13:18.120
Shouldn't I have a blood test, an X-ray,

13:18.120 --> 13:19.240
or a CT scan or something?

13:19.240 --> 13:20.519
No need.

13:20.519 --> 13:21.960
Your right eye...

13:21.960 --> 13:23.639
is from sleeping on it.

13:23.639 --> 13:26.380
And a mosquito bit your left eye.

13:28.679 --> 13:30.740
What did I tell you?

13:31.519 --> 13:33.960
Then... how should it be treated?

13:33.960 --> 13:36.960
Just use some eye drops and it'll be fine.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.240
No shots, pills, or anti-inflammatories?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.720
Why shots?

13:40.720 --> 13:41.840
Why pills?

13:41.840 --> 13:42.960
You young people don't act

13:42.960 --> 13:44.039
like you're a patient.

13:44.039 --> 13:47.339
Remember, don't rub your eyes for a few days.

13:47.994 --> 13:49.519
Wait a minute, Doctor.

13:49.519 --> 13:52.320
My leg is hurt too. Who'll check that?

13:52.320 --> 13:53.639
- Your leg is hurt too?
- Yes.

13:53.639 --> 13:55.320
Let me see.

13:55.320 --> 13:57.403
W-Wait. Still you?

13:57.403 --> 13:59.879
Don't I need an X-ray first?

13:59.879 --> 14:01.840
I have to look at it first.

14:01.840 --> 14:04.080
Whether it swims, flies,
or walks on the ground,

14:04.080 --> 14:05.279
Dr. Zhuang can treat it.

14:05.279 --> 14:08.639
He even saved two poisoned wolfhounds.

14:08.639 --> 14:10.559
Is he a doctor or a vet?

14:10.559 --> 14:12.600
Don't listen to him.

14:12.600 --> 14:14.600
I got a license.

14:14.600 --> 14:16.740
Come on, let me see.

14:17.519 --> 14:20.020
It hurts!

14:24.240 --> 14:25.600
This right here...

14:25.600 --> 14:27.799
You just bumped it by accident.

14:27.799 --> 14:29.879
Just a surface wound. Bone's fine.

14:29.879 --> 14:31.320
But it hurts!

14:31.320 --> 14:33.960
Don't I need an X-ray
to know if the bone is fine?

14:33.960 --> 14:36.000
If I say it's fine, it's fine.

14:36.000 --> 14:37.679
You just bumped it.

14:37.679 --> 14:38.759
Be careful for a few days.

14:38.759 --> 14:40.000
Don't walk around too much.

14:40.000 --> 14:42.120
Apply some iodine and ointment,

14:42.120 --> 14:44.240
and you'll be fine.

14:44.240 --> 14:47.339
Come on, Wu. Come get the medicine with me.

14:57.399 --> 15:00.600
Who is this girl to you?

15:00.600 --> 15:02.440
A real piece of work.

15:02.440 --> 15:04.360
There you go again.

15:04.360 --> 15:05.639
She's my cousin.

15:05.639 --> 15:06.919
It's her first time here,

15:06.919 --> 15:10.000
so she makes a fuss over everything.

15:10.000 --> 15:12.039
Here's the girl's medicine.

15:12.039 --> 15:14.939
Change the dressing every twelve hours.

15:15.519 --> 15:17.720
Here's your grandma's meds for the month.

15:17.720 --> 15:18.919
Herbal meds, oral.

15:18.919 --> 15:20.200
Ointment, external.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.519
That's it.

15:21.519 --> 15:23.080
Got it. Thanks, Dr. Zhuang.

15:23.080 --> 15:24.320
Go on.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.900
Help the girl apply the ointment.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.519
Come on, put your foot up.

15:37.519 --> 15:39.159
What are you doing?

15:39.159 --> 15:40.240
Applying the ointment.

15:40.240 --> 15:42.200
The doctor won't do it?

15:42.200 --> 15:44.360
Young lady, don't act like a helpless patient.

15:44.360 --> 15:46.579
You'll have to do it yourself at home.

15:47.519 --> 15:49.339
Put it up.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.660
It hurts.

16:40.100 --> 16:42.353
Hold on. What is this?

16:44.159 --> 16:46.200
It doesn't even have a label or a permit.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.679
Is it safe to use?

16:47.679 --> 16:49.559
Dr. Zhuang's secret ointment.

16:49.559 --> 16:51.519
Specially for sprains and bruises.

16:51.519 --> 16:53.319
It works.

17:28.839 --> 17:30.639
All done.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.540
Don't we have to pay?

17:36.400 --> 17:37.839
No need.

17:37.839 --> 17:39.599
Put it on my tab.

17:39.599 --> 17:41.740
You can have a tab here?

17:42.559 --> 17:43.759
That's how we do it here.

17:43.759 --> 17:46.659
Not just a tab, we pay monthly.

17:48.279 --> 17:49.839
Let's add each other on WeChat.

17:49.839 --> 17:52.180
I'll pay you for the medicine.

17:55.079 --> 17:56.799
If you don't want to add me, fine.

17:56.799 --> 17:58.119
Next time I need you,

17:58.119 --> 17:59.920
I'll just shout for you.

17:59.920 --> 18:02.319
Fine, let's add each other.

18:02.319 --> 18:05.000
While you're at it, cover my fare too.

18:05.000 --> 18:07.099
One yuan per step.

18:10.599 --> 18:12.399
There.

18:24.039 --> 18:26.359
- Let's go.
- Dr. Zhuang said

18:26.359 --> 18:28.819
I should avoid walking.

18:34.799 --> 18:36.599
Come on.

18:37.799 --> 18:40.339
One yuan per step is too expensive.

18:42.319 --> 18:44.339
Going back is free.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.640
Hurry up, hurry up.

18:50.640 --> 18:52.499
Don't let everyone see me like this.

18:52.499 --> 18:54.359
Hurry up.

18:55.160 --> 18:58.260
On purpose? Are you going or not?

19:00.319 --> 19:01.400
Hurry.

19:01.400 --> 19:03.460
Xing Wu!

19:04.400 --> 19:05.799
- Wu.
- Good morning, madam.

19:05.799 --> 19:09.039
- What's going on here?
- This... Ye, what happened to your eyes?

19:09.039 --> 19:11.119
And what happened to your foot?

19:11.119 --> 19:15.053
I got bitten in the eye, sprained my foot.

19:16.000 --> 19:18.880
- Be careful.
- I'll take her back now.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.559
- Hurry up.
- Rest up and get well.

19:20.559 --> 19:23.119
You've got the medicine, so take it.

19:23.119 --> 19:25.079
My goodness. Look at this girl.

19:25.079 --> 19:27.240
Yesterday when she got here,
she was all dressed up.

19:27.240 --> 19:29.160
Today, she's out in her pajamas,

19:29.160 --> 19:30.319
letting Xing Wu carry her.

19:30.319 --> 19:31.839
Exactly.

19:31.839 --> 19:33.799
She adapts pretty fast.

19:33.799 --> 19:35.440
You have no idea. This morning,

19:35.440 --> 19:36.799
she was shouting just like Fang.

19:36.799 --> 19:38.920
Yelling at the top of her lungs.
Totally fierce.

19:38.920 --> 19:40.240
Really?

19:40.240 --> 19:41.240
She's one of us now.

19:41.240 --> 19:42.599
She's just going native.

19:42.599 --> 19:44.343
True.

19:44.343 --> 19:45.680
- You're back.
- Mom.

19:45.680 --> 19:48.280
- Here, here.
- Come on.

19:49.680 --> 19:51.500
Careful.

19:53.519 --> 19:54.519
Give this to me.

19:54.519 --> 19:56.400
Come on.

19:56.400 --> 19:58.000
Up you go.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.800
Good.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.440
What did Dr. Zhuang say?

20:08.440 --> 20:10.880
Dr. Zhuang's clinic can't handle her case.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.160
Needs a real hospital in the city.

20:12.160 --> 20:14.119
She might even need surgery.

20:14.119 --> 20:16.540
Amputation's not off the table.

20:17.279 --> 20:19.200
That serious?

20:19.200 --> 20:20.799
It's all your fault.

20:20.799 --> 20:23.880
- Well...
- Why not look after your cousin better?

20:23.880 --> 20:25.119
Ye, I'm so sorry.

20:25.119 --> 20:26.759
It's not that serious.

20:26.759 --> 20:28.960
Don't listen to his nonsense.

20:28.960 --> 20:32.339
Just some eye drops and ointment,
and I'll be fine.

20:34.960 --> 20:36.039
That's a relief.

20:36.039 --> 20:37.400
I'm glad it's not that serious.

20:37.400 --> 20:39.079
Then make sure you use the eye drops.

20:39.079 --> 20:40.799
And apply the ointment properly.

20:40.799 --> 20:42.960
I went next door especially

20:42.960 --> 20:45.279
to buy you buns and fried dough sticks.

20:45.279 --> 20:47.359
And I made you pork trotter soup.

20:47.359 --> 20:49.619
Eat what you hurt to heal it.

20:51.079 --> 20:52.940
It's okay.

20:54.288 --> 20:56.108
I'm not hungry.

20:57.799 --> 20:59.880
Don't worry about the final payment.

20:59.880 --> 21:02.200
It's not about the money.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.200
I'm just...

21:03.200 --> 21:05.460
I'm just glad you're okay.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.279
I'm full.

21:09.279 --> 21:11.180
I'm heading to Shunyi.

21:11.839 --> 21:14.740
Okay, be careful on the road.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.240
What do you want for lunch?

21:20.240 --> 21:22.319
I'll cook for you.

21:22.319 --> 21:24.500
I haven't decided yet.

21:28.880 --> 21:31.279
Why don't you order from next door?

21:31.279 --> 21:33.500
Their food is good.

21:34.160 --> 21:36.720
I'll be at the Mahjong Club.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.960
Play some mahjong.

21:37.960 --> 21:39.799
Just shout if you need anything.

21:39.799 --> 21:40.839
I'll hear you.

21:40.839 --> 21:43.300
Okay. I understand.

21:44.039 --> 21:46.619
I'll just go now.

22:29.416 --> 22:32.557
[Shunyi Repairs]

22:47.880 --> 22:49.519
The repairs are done.

22:49.519 --> 22:51.839
Tell the owners to come pick them up.

22:51.839 --> 22:53.400
That was fast.

22:53.400 --> 22:56.039
Wu, you really don't want to
partner up at Shunyi?

22:56.039 --> 22:57.400
With our skills,

22:57.400 --> 23:00.240
we could dominate Anzi County.

23:00.240 --> 23:03.115
Shunyi only needs one boss, and that's you.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.519
True.

23:05.519 --> 23:06.759
So many people in Zhazhating

23:06.759 --> 23:08.940
are still counting on you.

23:14.960 --> 23:16.559
Canine.

23:16.559 --> 23:18.440
Send any work you have my way lately.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.440
Anything is fine.

23:19.440 --> 23:21.519
House calls too.

23:21.519 --> 23:22.559
Are you short on cash?

23:22.559 --> 23:23.960
Always.

23:23.960 --> 23:26.759
You can never have enough money.

23:26.759 --> 23:27.960
What a coincidence.

23:27.960 --> 23:30.899
This morning, a big spender came in.

23:31.839 --> 23:34.160
His phone is a brand-new model.

23:34.160 --> 23:35.720
It's too new for me.

23:35.720 --> 23:38.020
I can't fix it.

23:41.359 --> 23:43.220
Thanks.

23:48.799 --> 23:51.260
Looks like luck is on your side.

24:12.359 --> 24:15.559
You're Qing Ye, right?

24:15.559 --> 24:17.720
I've seen you when you were little.

24:17.720 --> 24:20.419
You're all grown up now.

24:21.160 --> 24:23.020
Grandma.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.240
Grandma,

24:25.240 --> 24:26.720
if you ever need any help,

24:26.720 --> 24:27.799
just let me know.

24:27.799 --> 24:30.160
- Okay.
- I'll be staying here for a while.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.599
Sorry for the trouble.

24:31.599 --> 24:34.899
It's fine. Thank you.

24:36.279 --> 24:38.859
What happened to your eye?

24:40.519 --> 24:42.619
A mosquito bite.

24:43.240 --> 24:46.319
And... you hurt your foot too?

24:46.319 --> 24:48.559
It's nothing. I just took a fall.

24:48.559 --> 24:49.920
Well...

24:49.920 --> 24:51.279
Grandma.

24:51.279 --> 24:52.920
Grandma, let me get you some water.

24:52.920 --> 24:55.359
Alright, alright.

24:55.359 --> 24:56.880
Good.

24:58.079 --> 25:00.240
- Thank you.
- It's nothing.

25:00.240 --> 25:03.240
You're such a good girl.

25:03.240 --> 25:04.400
Well...

25:04.400 --> 25:05.880
Call me if you need anything.

25:05.880 --> 25:06.960
Okay.

25:06.960 --> 25:09.237
- I'm going upstairs.
- Alright.

25:10.160 --> 25:11.400
Go get some rest.

25:11.400 --> 25:12.974
Okay.

25:36.119 --> 25:38.575
The ointment works quite well.

25:40.055 --> 25:43.319
[Yitong Restaurant]

25:43.319 --> 25:44.640
Hurry up!

25:44.640 --> 25:46.400
What should I play?

25:46.400 --> 25:48.400
Qing Ye is here.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.279
Why are you out here?

25:50.279 --> 25:53.039
My foot is almost healed.
I came out for a stroll.

25:53.039 --> 25:54.920
Are you hungry?

25:54.920 --> 25:57.200
Yes. I want to order food from Yitong.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.880
The owner isn't there.

25:58.880 --> 26:00.915
I'm right here.

26:01.519 --> 26:03.160
What would you like to eat?

26:03.160 --> 26:04.920
You'd better write this down.

26:04.920 --> 26:06.519
Four dishes and a soup for every meal.

26:06.519 --> 26:08.960
For breakfast, half the portion
and swap the soup for milk.

26:08.960 --> 26:10.803
For each meal, at least two types of protein,

26:10.803 --> 26:11.970
at least two types of veggies,

26:11.970 --> 26:13.338
and no more than two types of carbs.

26:13.338 --> 26:16.365
Right. Make more food that's easy to swallow.

26:16.365 --> 26:18.463
And add a steamed egg with sea urchin.

26:18.463 --> 26:21.240
By the way, are your portions really big here?

26:21.240 --> 26:23.720
It should be enough for two people.

26:24.365 --> 26:26.510
That's a lot of demands.

26:27.738 --> 26:30.119
It's... it's not...
I'm not taking your business.

26:30.119 --> 26:32.157
Look, my business here is doing just fine.

26:32.157 --> 26:35.916
When it's mealtime,
I'm really too busy to manage.

26:37.496 --> 26:40.767
Alipay received 1,000 yuan.

26:44.440 --> 26:47.839
Even if I'm busy,
I have to prioritize you, don't I?

26:47.839 --> 26:50.807
This is an advance payment.
It includes labor and service fees.

26:50.807 --> 26:52.000
We'll square up later.

26:52.000 --> 26:54.160
Okay, okay. Your health comes first.

26:54.160 --> 26:56.238
So, what'll you have? Say that again.

26:56.238 --> 26:57.284
Auntie Shanxi,

26:57.284 --> 26:59.160
one order of mackerel dumplings to go.

26:59.160 --> 27:00.480
Wait a minute.

27:00.480 --> 27:02.119
How did you get back so soon?

27:02.119 --> 27:04.079
None of your business.

27:04.079 --> 27:05.160
Go on.

27:05.160 --> 27:06.519
- For every meal,
- For every meal,

27:06.519 --> 27:09.371
- four dishes and one soup.
- four dishes and one soup.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.759
Grandma.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.268
Grandma, time to eat.

27:18.904 --> 27:21.612
I'm not hungry yet.

27:22.640 --> 27:25.279
Where did you go just now?

27:25.279 --> 27:27.079
Grandma,

27:27.680 --> 27:30.400
I took Qing Ye to see the doctor this morning,

27:30.400 --> 27:32.599
so I couldn't bring you food.

27:32.599 --> 27:34.759
These are dumplings Auntie Shanxi made for you.

27:34.759 --> 27:35.839
Here, have a taste.

27:35.839 --> 27:37.440
Okay.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.920
Here.

27:38.920 --> 27:40.528
The vinegar smells good.

27:41.680 --> 27:43.720
It's delicious.

27:43.720 --> 27:45.640
Let me tell you something.

27:45.640 --> 27:47.000
Now,

27:47.000 --> 27:49.680
it's not just you being filial anymore.

27:49.680 --> 27:53.558
I've got an extra granddaughter now,
looking after me.

27:59.279 --> 28:02.119
Fruit! Fruit!

28:02.119 --> 28:04.680
Tofu!

28:04.680 --> 28:07.039
Fruit! Fruit!

28:07.039 --> 28:09.644
Tofu!

28:11.425 --> 28:13.119
Wu!

28:13.119 --> 28:14.319
Liu Nian.

28:14.319 --> 28:15.960
Why are you coming out of Grandma's room?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.359
I'm doing housekeeping.

28:17.359 --> 28:18.440
Housekeeping?

28:18.440 --> 28:19.720
Just helping Grandma

28:19.720 --> 28:22.227
dust and clean her room.

28:23.440 --> 28:24.759
Housekeeping is fine.

28:24.759 --> 28:25.880
Just don't disturb Grandma.

28:25.880 --> 28:27.919
Don't worry, no problem.

29:06.759 --> 29:08.119
In a small place like that,

29:08.119 --> 29:09.519
as long as the money is right,

29:09.519 --> 29:11.359
everything is easy.

29:11.359 --> 29:14.407
Why didn't he take the money?

29:32.000 --> 29:34.599
Cousin!

29:34.599 --> 29:37.319
Stop yelling. I'm not your cousin.

29:37.319 --> 29:39.200
Hey, don't be like that.

29:39.200 --> 29:41.295
First time's a stranger, second time's family.

29:41.295 --> 29:42.599
I'm actually a pretty good guy.

29:42.599 --> 29:44.383
You just need to get to know me.

29:44.383 --> 29:47.264
Oh, right. I saw your package at the station.
Grabbed it for you.

29:47.264 --> 29:49.799
Okay, thank you.

29:49.799 --> 29:51.920
Don't mention it.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.925
Wu's cousin is my cousin too.

29:53.925 --> 29:56.720
Whatever you need, just say the word.

29:56.720 --> 29:59.519
Where else sells fruit around here?
I want some fruit.

29:59.519 --> 30:01.335
Of course there are. Look,

30:01.335 --> 30:03.495
we have plenty of local produce.
We have all kinds of fruit.

30:03.495 --> 30:04.839
What do you want? I'll get it.

30:04.839 --> 30:07.559
I want avocados and cherries.

30:07.559 --> 30:09.799
- Can't get them?
- No way.

30:09.799 --> 30:11.843
Let me tell you,
even if they're at the North Pole,

30:11.843 --> 30:14.166
I'll dive in and swim there
to bring them back for you.

30:14.166 --> 30:15.247
QR code for payment.

30:15.247 --> 30:17.253
No need.

30:36.200 --> 30:38.517
Thanks, I've received it all.

30:39.905 --> 30:42.942
Get ready for school
over the next couple of days.

30:48.079 --> 30:50.799
Can you keep a low profile
since you're new here?

30:50.799 --> 30:53.037
How am I being high-profile?

30:54.079 --> 30:55.559
Flaunting your wealth as soon as you arrive.

30:55.559 --> 30:57.279
Around here, it's not like your big city.

30:57.279 --> 30:58.640
Be careful not to get targeted.

30:58.640 --> 31:00.559
How am I flaunting wealth?

31:00.559 --> 31:02.359
I wasn't showing off.

31:02.359 --> 31:05.599
I'm just spending money on services.

31:05.599 --> 31:08.599
Besides, don't people here love money?

31:08.599 --> 31:10.079
Thanks for the warning,

31:10.079 --> 31:12.798
but how I spend my money is my business.

31:14.000 --> 31:16.161
Suit yourself.

31:35.359 --> 31:38.880
Hi, everyone.
I'm so glad to introduce myself here.

31:38.880 --> 31:40.599
- My name is...
- Xing Wu!

31:40.599 --> 31:43.145
Are you out of your mind?

31:44.839 --> 31:47.556
Xing Wu, come out here!

31:50.677 --> 31:53.117
Did you change that door lock?

31:55.720 --> 31:58.000
Why should we be the ones to change it?

31:58.000 --> 32:00.640
It's already installed.
It's not like I asked you for money.

32:00.640 --> 32:03.559
The girl needs to shower.
What if someone peeps at her?

32:03.559 --> 32:05.960
Have you lost your mind?

32:05.960 --> 32:08.799
I've showered here for so many years.
Who has ever peeped?

32:08.799 --> 32:11.200
Besides, what do you mean by
"not ask me for money"?

32:11.200 --> 32:14.880
Is that how you talk to me?
Isn't your money our family's money?

32:14.880 --> 32:16.960
- How much was that lock?
- Wait, what are you doing?

32:16.960 --> 32:19.039
I'm going to make them split the cost.

32:19.039 --> 32:20.920
Is that really necessary?

32:20.920 --> 32:23.319
You spent hundreds on clothes
without batting an eye.

32:23.319 --> 32:24.920
It's just a lock.

32:24.920 --> 32:27.000
Yes, it is! It is! It is!

32:27.000 --> 32:29.079
The showerhead, the water heater,
the light bulbs...

32:29.079 --> 32:31.319
Our family's replaced the most of them.

32:31.319 --> 32:33.519
Do they ever show us any gratitude?

32:33.519 --> 32:34.599
Last winter,

32:34.599 --> 32:36.359
Wu Lao Er found a scrap wire

32:36.359 --> 32:38.200
and put it in our yard
to use as a clothesline.

32:38.200 --> 32:40.839
Then, just for ten yuan,
he hounded me for a month.

32:40.839 --> 32:44.831
Why's it always us paying?
Why is it always us?

32:44.831 --> 32:46.697
How much?

32:47.655 --> 32:49.000
W-What?

32:49.000 --> 32:50.079
How much for the lock?

32:50.079 --> 32:51.359
I'll pay.

32:51.359 --> 32:52.880
Is five hundred enough?

32:52.880 --> 32:55.593
Wait... Qing Ye.

32:57.079 --> 32:58.319
I didn't mean for you to...

32:58.319 --> 33:02.079
Alipay received 500 yuan.

33:02.079 --> 33:05.295
It's just a lock.
Is it really worth all this fuss?

33:07.440 --> 33:09.353
Just say I asked for it.

33:11.720 --> 33:13.079
No.

33:13.079 --> 33:17.126
We didn't mean for you to pay.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.000
I transferred the 500 yuan to you.

33:43.000 --> 33:45.160
Make sure to accept it.

33:45.160 --> 33:46.797
Forget it.

33:53.720 --> 33:55.000
Li Lan Fang was arguing with me

33:55.000 --> 33:58.720
because she felt the neighbors were using her.
She felt it was unfair.

33:58.720 --> 34:01.024
It's not about the money at all.

34:01.640 --> 34:03.160
Well, I don't care anyway.

34:03.160 --> 34:05.790
Just think of it as me paying
for some peace and quiet.

34:08.880 --> 34:12.066
Do you think that all of us
can be bought off with money?

34:13.760 --> 34:16.559
- I didn't say that.
- Your actions say otherwise.

34:16.559 --> 34:19.146
Think whatever you want.

34:20.079 --> 34:21.440
To be honest,

34:21.440 --> 34:22.719
your mom asked me to stay here.

34:22.719 --> 34:24.239
And you changed the lock for me.

34:24.239 --> 34:26.890
Wasn't it only because I paid you?

34:29.760 --> 34:31.537
What do you take us for?

34:32.519 --> 34:34.228
What do I take you for?

34:34.960 --> 34:37.119
Here, take a good look.

34:37.119 --> 34:39.280
Party A and Party B, signed and sealed.

34:39.280 --> 34:41.321
- Look closely.
- I've never acknowledged

34:41.321 --> 34:42.519
a single word on this paper.

34:42.519 --> 34:43.639
I don't care.

34:43.639 --> 34:45.519
We're still Party A and Party B.

34:45.519 --> 34:46.639
Since I'm paying,

34:46.639 --> 34:49.559
I deserve a quiet and comfortable environment.

34:49.559 --> 34:51.519
With this attitude of yours,

34:51.519 --> 34:54.760
I could easily refuse to pay the balance.

34:54.760 --> 34:57.719
Do you think having money
means you can do whatever you want?

34:57.719 --> 35:00.559
Here for the service and a vacation, huh?
Leave right now.

35:00.559 --> 35:03.230
Pack your things and go to a hotel.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.541
Fine, I'll leave.

35:12.179 --> 35:15.436
I don't want to stay in this dump
for another second!

35:36.000 --> 35:39.360
- Miss, need a ride?
- Yeah.

35:39.360 --> 35:40.920
Give it here.

35:40.920 --> 35:43.245
Okay. Thank you.

35:44.311 --> 35:46.000
Hold on tight.

35:46.000 --> 35:47.815
Sit tight.

35:48.980 --> 35:50.079
Where are we going?

35:50.079 --> 35:52.360
Just keep driving straight.

35:52.360 --> 35:55.679
Straight ahead? We'll end up in the sea.

35:55.679 --> 35:58.519
Then take me to the best hotel in town.

35:58.519 --> 36:00.300
You got it.

36:02.039 --> 36:04.139
Hold on.

36:37.880 --> 36:41.234
Family dinner, a happy reunion.

36:54.208 --> 36:56.039
[Zhazha Grand Hotel]

36:56.039 --> 36:58.198
Attack him!

37:00.119 --> 37:02.268
Such a noob.

37:07.294 --> 37:09.848
Go for it, bro.

37:27.360 --> 37:29.653
No, you go.

37:33.599 --> 37:35.698
Hello?

37:37.840 --> 37:39.559
Hello!

37:39.559 --> 37:40.960
Hi there!

37:40.960 --> 37:43.119
Hold on, hold on. I have a guest.

37:43.119 --> 37:44.840
I'd like a room.

37:44.840 --> 37:47.461
Take your pick.

37:55.239 --> 37:56.559
588 yuan.

37:56.559 --> 37:58.320
Is that your best room?

37:58.320 --> 37:59.360
Of course.

37:59.360 --> 38:02.679
588 is our signature.
A luxury ocean-view suite.

38:02.679 --> 38:04.880
In all of Zhazhating,
you won't find anything better.

38:04.880 --> 38:05.960
Got air conditioning?

38:05.960 --> 38:07.719
- Of course it does.
- What about Wi-Fi?

38:07.719 --> 38:09.719
Wi-Fi?

38:09.719 --> 38:11.119
Girl,

38:11.119 --> 38:14.160
haven't you stayed in a hotel before?

38:17.000 --> 38:19.498
Just check me in, please.

39:38.360 --> 39:41.199
Air conditioning and no Xing Wu.

39:41.199 --> 39:44.493
I can finally get some good sleep.

39:52.156 --> 39:54.119
Qing Ye, I checked the weather.

39:54.119 --> 39:56.519
Is it raining where you are?

39:56.519 --> 39:58.760
I found some videos and courseware
for the preparatory courses.

39:58.760 --> 40:01.079
You can watch them during summer break.

40:01.079 --> 40:03.392
Okay, thank you.

40:22.400 --> 40:23.519
Wait...

40:23.519 --> 40:25.828
The internet is down?

40:45.279 --> 40:47.280
Wu!

40:47.280 --> 40:49.168
- Coming!
- Liu Nian.

40:50.679 --> 40:52.880
Wu.

40:52.880 --> 40:54.518
Wu.

40:54.518 --> 40:56.288
Wu!

40:56.920 --> 40:58.559
- I brought you food.
- Okay.

40:58.559 --> 41:00.920
This is the special meal Qing Ye ordered
from my mom.

41:00.920 --> 41:02.996
It's enough for two people.

41:03.719 --> 41:05.519
Thanks.

41:05.519 --> 41:07.599
Well, then... Hurry up and eat.

41:07.599 --> 41:09.342
Okay.

41:10.070 --> 41:12.970
- Bye, Liu Nian.
- Bye-bye.

41:31.119 --> 41:33.320
Make more food that's easy to swallow.

41:33.320 --> 41:36.039
And add a steamed egg with sea urchin.

41:36.039 --> 41:37.960
Are your portions really big here?

41:37.960 --> 41:39.679
It should be enough for two people.

41:39.679 --> 41:42.320
You're not the only filial one.

41:42.320 --> 41:46.795
I've got an extra granddaughter now,
looking after me.

41:53.013 --> 41:54.703
Wu.

41:55.559 --> 41:56.960
Wu.

41:56.960 --> 41:58.416
I'm done with the cleaning.

41:58.416 --> 41:59.800
I'll head off now.

41:59.800 --> 42:01.486
Okay.
Take an umbrella.

42:01.486 --> 42:04.092
- Okay.
- It's going to rain.

42:08.719 --> 42:11.599
Wu. I'll say one more thing.

42:11.599 --> 42:13.519
Actually...

42:13.519 --> 42:15.944
Qing Ye is quite nice.

42:16.800 --> 42:19.159
Oh yeah? Did she buy you off?

42:19.159 --> 42:21.039
No. How is that possible?

42:21.039 --> 42:22.320
Here's the thing.

42:22.320 --> 42:23.840
Do you want to make some extra money?

42:23.840 --> 42:25.039
Extra money?

42:25.039 --> 42:26.861
What extra money?

42:26.861 --> 42:28.446
I just want you to help me

42:28.446 --> 42:32.360
clean my room upstairs and Grandma's room.
Especially Grandma's room.

42:32.360 --> 42:34.840
Make sure you wipe away
all the dust.

42:34.840 --> 42:36.054
Grandma is sick, you know.

42:36.054 --> 42:39.159
That foul air is bad for her health.

42:39.159 --> 42:41.955
Buy some plants for her room, too.

42:44.159 --> 42:46.314
I'll get going then, Wu.

43:01.446 --> 43:02.599
What's up?

43:02.599 --> 43:04.039
It's late. Have you come to your senses?

43:04.039 --> 43:05.159
Hello, Mr. Zhu.

43:05.159 --> 43:07.800
Did you happen to pick up a girl
from outside my house?

43:07.800 --> 43:10.320
Yeah. There was a girl with a suitcase.

43:10.320 --> 43:12.199
Yes, that's her. Where did she go?

43:12.199 --> 43:14.792
Zhazha Grand Hotel.

43:20.719 --> 43:22.039
Hey, Hao.

43:22.039 --> 43:23.880
Is there a girl named Qing Ye

43:23.880 --> 43:25.862
staying at your place?

43:26.559 --> 43:27.960
She just checked in.

43:27.960 --> 43:29.159
To the ocean-view suite.

43:29.159 --> 43:31.199
Keep an eye on her for me.

43:31.199 --> 43:33.639
Contact me if anything happens.

43:33.639 --> 43:34.760
Got it.

43:34.760 --> 43:36.635
Thanks.
